  m_Name: Events_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a81e9b31bb227cd47a6df0bd03e83c80, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items:
    - rid: 3521288323481731073
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 51999449088
    m_Localized: A King''s Duty
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3521288323481731073
  - m_Id: 52049780736
    m_Localized: I watch as Aurelius listens patiently to a farmer''s dispute, his
      presence commanding yet gentle. He delivers a judgment that is both fair and
      compassionate, and the farmers leave with grateful bows. He is every inch the
      noble king. But as the throne room empties, his shoulders slump slightly. He
      turns to me, the warmth in his golden eyes replaced by a distant, haunted look.
      "A king''s duty is to his people," he says quietly. "But what of the duties
      a man owes to himself? To his own past?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52053975040
    m_Localized: Your duty to your people is what matters most. You are a good king.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52058169344
    m_Localized: What duties do you feel you''ve left undone?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52058169345
    m_Localized: The crown must be a heavy burden to bear alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52058169346
    m_Localized: A Rumor of Shadows
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52058169347
    m_Localized: Aurelius paces in front of the hearth, his brow furrowed. "These
      rumors from the borderlands... a figure turning villagers against the crown,
      promising power... it feels like his work." He stops and looks at me, his gaze
      intense. "The council thinks it''s just a common brigand. They advise ignoring
      it. But I know better. This is the start of something."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52058169348
    m_Localized: Trust the council''s process. We''ll send official investigators.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52058169349
    m_Localized: The council is blind. Use your own agents. Find the truth quietly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52058169350
    m_Localized: Let''s go ourselves. We can''t trust this to anyone else.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64662769541120
    m_Localized: Aurelius''s Downfall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64662840844288
    m_Localized: The kingdom is in chaos. Aurelius, broken by his past, has become
      a tyrant. The people suffer under his iron fist, and the whispers of rebellion
      have grown into a roar. I stand before him in the throne room, the weight of
      his failure heavy in the air. He looks at me, his eyes hollow, the golden light
      extinguished. "This is what I have wrought," he says, his voice a mere shadow
      of its former strength. "This is the legacy of a king who could not escape
      his own darkness."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64662840844289
    m_Localized: You have failed your people.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64662840844290
    m_Localized: There is still time to make amends.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64662840844291
    m_Localized: I will stand with you, no matter what.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64662840844292
    m_Localized: Aurelius''s Redemption
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64662840844293
    m_Localized: The kingdom is at peace. Aurelius, having confronted his past, rules
      with a just and gentle hand. The people flourish, and the land heals. I stand
      with him on the balcony of the palace, overlooking the thriving city. He turns
      to me, his golden eyes bright with a newfound serenity. "We did it," he says,
      his voice filled with a quiet strength. "We built a future worthy of the sacrifices
      made."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64662840844294
    m_Localized: You did it, Aurelius. You saved them all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64662840844295
    m_Localized: The kingdom is stronger than ever before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64662840844296
    m_Localized: I am proud to have stood by your side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64662840844297
    m_Localized: Aurelius''s Uneasy Peace
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64662840844298
    m_Localized: The immediate threat is gone, but the kingdom remains scarred. Aurelius,
      though victorious, is a changed man. The warmth in his eyes is now tempered
      by a permanent shadow of vigilance. He rules justly, but without the easy grace
      he once possessed. The peace is real, but it is a fragile thing, bought at
      a high price."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64662840844299
    m_Localized: The kingdom is safe. That is what matters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64662840844300
    m_Localized: You carry a heavy burden.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64662840844301
    m_Localized: We will face whatever comes next together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64662840844302
    m_Localized: A Trail Grown Cold
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64662840844303
    m_Localized: Weeks of searching have yielded nothing. The trail of the shadow
      figure has gone cold, and the borderlands have fallen quiet. Aurelius is frustrated,
      his every instinct telling him the danger has not passed. "He''s still out
      there, I know it," he says, slamming a fist on the table. "He''s planning something,
      and we''re sitting here blind."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64662840844304
    m_Localized: Patience, Aurelius. He will make a mistake eventually.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64662840844305
    m_Localized: Let''s expand the search. Double our efforts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64662840844306
    m_Localized: Perhaps the danger has passed. We can''t chase ghosts forever.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
